Upstream code
-------------
This worker wraps official projects/inference_seedvr2_3b.py (and optionally
inference_seedvr2_7b.py) from ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR (Apache License 2.0,
© 2025 seed / ByteDance Seed), pinned to SHA
e4de8c24441a67e1b7df56abea10645059bb1185:
https://github.com/ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR

The official upstream LICENSE is copied at LICENSE.upstream. The official
README states: "SeedVR and SeedVR2 are licensed under the Apache 2.0."

SeedVR v1 scripts (projects/inference_seedvr_3b.py and
projects/inference_seedvr_7b.py) are never imported or executed.

color_fix.py from pkuliyi2015/sd-webui-stablesr is **not** shipped. That file
is licensed under the S-Lab License 1.0 (non-commercial only) and must not
appear in a commercial Hub listing. Official SeedVR already treats color fix
as optional (`if os.path.exists(...)`; otherwise "Color fix is not avaliable!").
This worker forces `use_colorfix=False`.

Weights
-------
Default weights are downloaded at runtime from the public Hugging Face catalog
ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR2-3B (revision 37255ff8cccfb01071b87f635a5948ca8d53117c).
The Hugging Face model card marks them `license: apache-2.0` and `gated: false`.
The weight repository does not ship a LICENSE file (raw 404); this NOTICE and
the README record Apache-2.0 and attribute ByteDance Seed. Optional SeedVR2-7B
weights (revision eb0c4281d41ba3767d4f14370f0e37e9e9180c16) use the same
license. The 7B-sharp checkpoint is not downloaded with the 7B option. Weights
are **not** baked into the image.

The official prebuilt apex wheel (`apex-0.1-cp310-cp310-linux_x86_64.whl`,
python=3.10, torch=2.4.0, cuda=12.1) is installed into the Docker image from
that same 3B revision. It is a build dependency, not a model checkpoint, and
is not stored in the weight cache.

